\cb2 Each row of the various sheets corresponds to a single test step. They are then grouped together into a test suite, which are listed in the Group sheet. Each step will have its own set of conditions to check under the Test and Measure sheets. AppStim is where the temperature settings are listed. Mode_Select defines the different button combos for navigation. Those definitions are called by name in the Measure sheet. Each "DO#" corresponds to a digital IO pin on a peripheral device. There's a few other sheets for test step info and failure info, but the ones mentioned are the most critical.\'a0\cb1 \
